* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
# A frozen HTTP response is the bytes a server sent, CR LF and all.
*.http binary
# A font's licence is carried as its foundry published it, byte for byte
# (ADR 0084 § 5): DM Sans' OFL.txt ends its lines CR LF.
crates/alo-renderer/interface/fonts/*.txt -text
